    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0100_rival_11",
      "hash64": "52924E3E0601C73C",
      "text": "It’s the path that leads to adventure for you\\nand me!\\c\\nOut here, things are different than in town.\\nYou’re gonna see wild Pokémon out and about.\\r\\nThey’ll be on the path and in the grass and such![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
